This product includes software derived from vLLM (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm),
Copyright contributors to the vLLM project, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The derived files are Go translations of vLLM's Python engine logic at the release named in
each file's header (vLLM v0.32.0, commit 5df63a7203cdb9328d824a27b682e77c7b9928be, unless the
file says otherwise). Each such file starts with:

    // SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
    // SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright contributors to the vLLM project
    // Derived from vllm/<path> at vLLM <tag> (<commit>).

so the upstream file and commit of every ported function can be found and diffed when vLLM
moves. A file with no such header is original to this repository.

This product also includes software moved from inference-sim
(https://github.com/inference-sim/inference-sim), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. A moved file records the inference-sim commit it was taken from.
